title: "NIST 800-53 to MITRE ATT&CK enterprise ontology"
abstract: "An enterprise ontology and knowledge graph mapping NIST SP 800-53 Rev. 5 controls to MITRE ATT&CK Enterprise 16.1 techniques, aligned to ATT&CK STIX, NIST OSCAL and UCO, with a browser-based gap analysis, ATT&CK Navigator exports and tested competency questions."
type: dataset
authors:
